      "description": "A hearty and nutritious quinoa bowl with roasted vegetables, chickpeas, and a lemon-tahini dressing.",
      "comments": "Can be served warm or cold.",
      "complexity": "Easy",
      "dietary_preferences": ["vegetarian", "vegan", "dairy-free"],
      "ingredients": [
